<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PacifiCare &quot;buy&quot; reiterated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PacifiCare &quot;buy&quot; reiterated.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney reiterated a buy rating on PacifiCare Health Systems Inc, a Smith Barney source said.</p>
<p>-- Late Monday, PacifiCare said it expects its second quarter earnings to fall below the First Call consensus estimate of $1.16 a share. The company blamed the expected shortfall on substantially lower performance in a number of FHP International Co markets and in disappointing results in California last month. PacifiCare bought FHP in February.</p>
<p>-- PacifiCare's Class B shares dropped 17-1/4 to 68-1/4.</p>
</text>
